# generated Prisma client — regenerated fresh by the root "postinstall" script
# on every `npm install` (dev machine or Vercel build), never committed.
# Found live (2026-08-28): a committed Windows-only client crashed every
# deployed app's first real DB query on Vercel's Linux runtime — see
# packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma's binaryTargets comment for the full story.
packages/db/generated/
